# player_picker.js — Player Selection Modal
# File: data/player_picker.js

## PURPOSE
IIFE-based modal for selecting players from groups before a game. Used by setup pages.

## PUBLIC API
- PlayerPicker.open(numSlots, callback): Open modal, numSlots = max players needed
- PlayerPicker.close(): Close modal
- PlayerPicker.selectGroup(groupId): Switch displayed group
- PlayerPicker.togglePlayer(id, name, checked): Toggle player selection
- PlayerPicker.toggleAll(): Select/deselect all in current group
- PlayerPicker.apply(): Return selected [{id, name}, ...] via callback

## DATA SOURCE
Fetches /api/players → {groups: [{id, name, players: [{id, name}]}]}

## UI FEATURES
- Bottom sheet modal on mobile
- Group dropdown with player count
- Checkboxes per player
- Counter: "n / numSlots" with color (gray=empty, yellow=partial, green=full, red=over)
- Select All / Deselect All toggle

## PERSISTENCE
- Last group: sessionStorage.pp_lastGroup
- Last selection per group: sessionStorage.pp_lastSelected_<groupId>

## SANITIZATION
sanitize(str, maxLen): removes {}, [], ", ', \, <, >, &, ` characters
